    {
      "id": "p0038-b005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "At first glance, Undertale doesn't seem particularly impressive - it has simple graphics, a strange battle system, and looks more like a fun little hobby project than a serious game. But first impressions can be deceiving: Undertale actually combines different game genres to create something fresh, sabotages veteran gamers' expectations about how games should work, and builds upon the foundation laid by previous generations of game creators.",
        "raw": "At first glance, Undertale doesn't seem particularly impressive - it has simple\ngraphics, a strange battle system, and looks more like a fun little hobby project\nthan a serious game. But first impressions can be deceiving: Undertale actually\ncombines different game genres to create something fresh, sabotages veteran\ngamers' expectations about how games should work, and builds upon the\nfoundation laid by previous generations of game creators.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.28882695,
          0.22215714,
          0.89066766,
          0.32572857
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.28679102,
          0.22144286,
          0.89700958,
          0.3268
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          7,
          8,
          9,
          10,
          11,
          12
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "乍看之下，Undertale 似乎并不惊艳：画面简单，战斗系统古怪，更像一个有趣的业余小项目，而非正经大作。但第一印象会骗人。它融合了不同游戏类型，创造出新鲜体验，打破老玩家对游戏运作方式的预期，也建立在前几代游戏创作者打下的基础上。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": [
          {
            "start": 5,
            "end": 14,
            "italic": true,
            "lang": "en"
          }
        ]
      },
