    {
      "id": "p0038-b006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "At its core, for example, Undertale combines the gameplay of a classic Japanese role-playing game with the mechanics of \"bullet hell\" shoot-em-up games. This unique combination surprised gamers when Undertale debuted.",
        "raw": "At its core, for example, Undertale combines the gameplay of a classic Japanese\nrole-playing game with the mechanics of \"bullet hell\" shoot-em-up games.\nThis unique combination surprised gamers when Undertale debuted.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.28930539,
          0.34148571,
          0.89497365,
          0.38925714
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.28679102,
          0.34077143,
          0.89700958,
          0.39032857
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          13,
          14,
          15
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "例如，Undertale 的核心玩法把经典日式角色扮演游戏与“弹幕”射击游戏结合起来。它首次推出时，这种独特组合让玩家吃了一惊。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": [
