    {
      "id": "p0038-b007",
      "kind": "caption",
      "source": {
        "text": "In Japanese RPGs, the player explores towns and dungeons while gathering information from villagers and other inhabitants",
        "raw": "In Japanese RPGs, the player explores towns\nand dungeons while gathering information\nfrom villagers and other inhabitants",
